name     files
summary  the file manager
usage    files
option   --room NAME text  the room it runs in, as the desktop's dock launches it
cwd      none
---
The desktop's file manager (stage 7h). The panel launches it from the dock
with a start-up record: the volume to read and, to change, ~ in home or the
room's grants (INV-0168-2). It opens files only through the panel.
